  "published": "2026-11-02T15:56:30.47Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.16: every JPEG XL extra channel decodes: premultiplied alpha is returned as straight alpha exactly as libjxl unpremultiplies it, spot colours are rendered like djxl, and depth, selection-mask, thermal and other channels are decoded and left out (Image.Load, the frame reader and JxlLayers). CMYK and float samples still throw NotSupportedException, naming the PictureSharp core support they need. Requires PictureSharp 0.9.1. See docs/releases/release-0.8.16.md and docs/design/0.8.16-extra-channels.md.",
